Hey there,

There have been too many failed attempts to sign in to <%= @user.email %>,
so we've locked sign in with a password<% if @duration %> for the next <%= distance_of_time_in_words(@duration) %><% end %>.

If that was you, you can get back in now by resetting your password:

<%= new_identity_password_reset_url %>

If it wasn't, someone may be trying to guess your password. Those attempts failed,
and devices you're already signed in on aren't affected. Consider changing
your password if you use it anywhere else.
